<title>USA: McDermott International delays meeting.</title>
<headline>McDermott International delays meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDermott International Inc said on Friday it rescheduled its annual shareholders meeting to September 2 from August 5.</p>
<p>The company said it was rescheduled to meet requirements for the timely mailing of proxy materials.</p>
<p>McDermott said the materials may be delayed because it has been unable to obtain audited financial statements from a foreign, unconsolidated affiliate of its majority-owned subsidiary, J. Ray McDermott.</p>
<p>For similar reasons, J. Ray McDermott delayed its own annual meeting to August 29, from August 1.</p>
</text>
